62
]. Moreover, two retrospective studies on NSCLC focused on the automated analysis of PD-L1 IHC images labeled with 22C3 and SP263 antibodies. These studies applied a CNN-based PD-L1 tumor proportion score (TPS) model, demonstrating high consistency with pathologist-calculated TPS results (
