168
] was trained on a large dataset of 7,983 pathological slides, enabling reliable evaluation of TILs across 23 different cancer types. Similarly, another study proposed a generalizable model for tumor-infiltrating lymphocytes classification across multiple cancer types by introducing a CNN simplification approach—Network Auto-Reduction—that substantially reduces computational cost (up to
